--
-- - consent_records: the consent step's answers, one row per item per submission, with the version,
--   the time, the client address and the User-Agent (#57-5). Append-only (UPDATE revoked below).
-- - nickname_holds: nicknames given up, held from other accounts for 30 days (#57-6, #37-16).
-- - profile_interest_categories: the account's interest categories (#57-7, N04 §2).
-- - profiles: the nickname step done (nickname_confirmed_at), the last change after it
